    'Methemoglobinemia',
    'A 2-month-old infant is evaluated for cyanosis after a topical anesthetic was applied for a minor procedure. Oxygen saturation is 88% despite 100% oxygen, and the blood appears chocolate-brown.',
    'Which of the following is the most appropriate treatment?',
    '[{"id":"A","text":"Methylene blue"},{"id":"B","text":"Hydroxocobalamin"},{"id":"C","text":"N-Acetylcysteine"},{"id":"D","text":"Deferoxamine"},{"id":"E","text":"Vitamin K"}]'::jsonb,
    'A',
    'Methemoglobinemia occurs when hemoglobin iron is oxidized to the ferric (Fe3+) state, which cannot bind oxygen and shifts the oxygen dissociation curve leftward. Methylene blue is reduced to leukomethylene blue, which reduces Fe3+ back to Fe2+ in a NADPH-dependent reaction; it is ineffective and potentially harmful in G6PD deficiency.',
    '{"B":"Hydroxocobalamin is used for cyanide poisoning.","C":"N-Acetylcysteine is the antidote for acetaminophen overdose.","D":"Deferoxamine chelates iron in iron poisoning.","E":"Vitamin K reverses warfarin."}'::jsonb,
    'easy'
where not exists (
  select 1 from public.questions
  where vignette = 'A 2-month-old infant is evaluated for cyanosis after a topical anesthetic was applied for a minor procedure. Oxygen saturation is 88% despite 100% oxygen, and the blood appears chocolate-brown.' and question = 'Which of the following is the most appropriate treatment?'
);

